# `set.size`, `map.size`, `view.length`: the read finds a getter of one of the engine's classes, which nothing replaces. It is the call of the getter's row: the code in line of the row, or the operation that the walk has for it.
# function made(a: number) { const set = new Set<number>(); set.add(a); return set.size; }
# What was made here and that nothing has changed since is as its class makes it: nothing is asked.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK-NOT: PropGet
# CHECK-NOT: IsPristine
# CHECK: = CallInline {{*}}inlineBuiltin=SetSize
# function looked(a: number) { const map = new Map<number, number>(); map.set(a, a); look(map); return map.size; }
# Code that nobody has seen may have hidden the name or put the object below something else. The object is asked at run time, one bit of its cell. One such read pays for that: closed, it is a lookup and the call of a native function out of a stub.
# RUN(LOOKED): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# LOOKED-LABEL: code f2:Body
# LOOKED: [[asMade]]: boolean {{*}}= IsPristine {{*}}builtinClass=Map
# LOOKED-NEXT: Branch [[asMade]]
# LOOKED: = CallInline {{*}}inlineBuiltin=MapSize
# LOOKED: frequency=Rare
# LOOKED: = PropGet {{*}}key="size"
# Without guesses nothing is asked, and the read is made as it is written.
# RUN(UNASKED): walk f2 mechanisms=all-Guesses
# UNASKED-LABEL: code f2:Body
# UNASKED-NOT: MapSize
# UNASKED: = PropGet {{*}}key="size"
# UNASKED-NOT: MapSize
# The rows belong to BuiltinCalls.
# RUN(WITHHELD): walk f1 f2 mechanisms=all-BuiltinCalls
# WITHHELD-LABEL: code f1:Body
# WITHHELD-NOT: SetSize
# WITHHELD: = PropGet {{*}}key="size"
# WITHHELD-LABEL: code f2:Body
# WITHHELD-NOT: MapSize
# WITHHELD: = PropGet {{*}}key="size"
# function view(n: number) { const numbers = new Int32Array(n); return numbers.length; }   function viewLooked(n: number) { const numbers = new Float64Array(n); look(numbers); return numbers.length; }
# The length of a view has an operation of its own.
# RUN(VIEW): walk f3 f4 mechanisms=all
# VIEW-LABEL: code f3:Body
# VIEW-NOT: PropGet
# VIEW-NOT: IsPristine
# VIEW: = GetTypedArrayLength
# VIEW-LABEL: code f4:Body
# VIEW: = IsPristine {{*}}builtinClass=Float64Array
# VIEW: = GetTypedArrayLength
# VIEW: = PropGet {{*}}key="length"

